# NBSC PRIME-HRM Intelligence Hub — Implementation Plan (v2)

A responsive, Django-backed HRMS for Northern Bukidnon State College.  
**Frontend:** Pure HTML + CSS + JS (no frameworks, no inline styles, no inline scripts).  
**Backend:** Django REST API (JSON only).  
Two completely separate directories — `frontend/` and `backend/`.

---

## What Changed from v1

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Frontend completely rewritten** per your request:
> - ❌ No Django templates, no HTMX, no React, no framework
> - ✅ Pure HTML files, external CSS files, external JS files
> - ✅ Each page = its own folder with its own `.html`, `.css`, `.js`
> - ✅ Zero inline `style=""` attributes — all styling in `.css` files
> - ✅ Zero `<script>` code in HTML — all logic in `.js` files
> - ✅ Full documentation of naming conventions, functions, components

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Backend becomes a pure REST API** — Django serves JSON endpoints only, no HTML rendering. The frontend uses `fetch()` to communicate with the backend.

