### Phase 4 — Payroll (Week 7)

Automate bi-monthly personnel compensation processing: Excel payroll workbook ingestion, ReportLab PDF payslip generation with official NBSC branding, PyPDF2 AES encryption using per-employee password (`last4_of_employee_ID + MMDDYYYY_of_DOB`), and secure employee self-service download portal.

