##### `apps/payroll/`
- **Models (`models.py`)**:
  - `PayrollBatch`: Period label (e.g. "September 1–15, 2026"), start date, end date, department, total employees, total gross, total net, uploaded by, status (`DRAFT`, `PROCESSED`, `DISTRIBUTED`), created at.
  - `PayslipRecord`: Batch reference, employee reference, employee_id, full name, position, salary grade, earnings dict (`basic_pay`, `pera`, `overtime`, `allowances`), deductions dict (`gsis`, `philhealth`, `pagibig`, `withholding_tax`, `loans`, `lates`), gross_pay, total_deductions, net_pay, encrypted_pdf_path, is_downloaded, first_downloaded_at.
